  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Healthcare Building Code</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of this project is to improve the design and application of the new building code for health infrastructure, using the support of Dutch experts and expertise. The Building Code is being developed by the Ukrainian Ministry of Health (MOH). The review of the draft building code by experts from the Netherlands will strengthen the technical quality of the code and will further advise on its applicability and practical consequences of its implementation including functional planning.</narrative>
  </description>
